<template><a-config-provider :locale="locale"><div class="design-root">
<div class="design-note"><b>B · #1463 개선 UI 목업</b><span>설계 예시 · 별칭/IPv6/실패는 합성 · 실제 서비스 변경 없음</span><a-select v-model:value="scenario" size="small" style="width:145px"><a-select-option value="fresh">정상 관측</a-select-option><a-select-option value="partial">일부 포트 실패</a-select-option><a-select-option value="stale">오래된 관측</a-select-option><a-select-option value="unavailable">조회 실패</a-select-option></a-select><a-switch v-model:checked="dark" checked-children="다크" un-checked-children="라이트"/></div>
<div class="shell"><aside><b>ABLESTACK</b><p>대시보드</p><p>컴퓨트　⌄</p><p>　가상머신</p><p>스토리지　⌄</p><div class="selected">공유 파일 시스템</div><p>네트워크</p><p>이미지</p></aside><div class="workspace"><header><span>☰　기본 보기</span><span>AC　admin cloud</span></header>
<a-card class="breadcrumb-card"><a-row align="middle"><a-col :span="18"><Breadcrumb :resource="{name:'sharedfs-listeners-design'}"><template #end><a-button size="small" shape="round"><ReloadOutlined/>업데이트</a-button></template></Breadcrumb></a-col><a-col :span="6" class="right"><a-button>작업 <DownOutlined/></a-button></a-col></a-row></a-card>
<main><ResourceLayout :wide="wide"><template #left><a-card class="info"><FileTextOutlined class="icon"/><h3>sharedfs-listeners-design</h3><a-badge status="success" text="사용 가능"/><dl><dt>주 IP</dt><dd>10.10.13.186 (예시)</dd><dt>네트워크</dt><dd>L2-Network · 1 NIC</dd><dt>DATA</dt><dd>10 GiB · XFS · SPARSE</dd><dt>계정 / Zone</dt><dd>admin / 13-Zone</dd></dl></a-card></template>
<template #right><a-card class="tab-card"><a-tabs v-model:activeKey="tab" tab-position="left"><a-tab-pane key="details" tab="상세"><a-list size="small" :data-source="details"><template #renderItem="{item}"><a-list-item><div class="detail"><strong>{{item[0]}}</strong><span>{{item[1]}}</span></div></a-list-item></template></a-list></a-tab-pane><a-tab-pane key="capacity" tab="용량·볼륨"/><a-tab-pane key="directory" tab="공유 디렉터리"/><a-tab-pane key="nfs" tab="NFS">
<div class="nfs-design-toolbar"><a-space wrap><a-button type="primary" @click="noop"><PlusOutlined/>NFS 내보내기 생성</a-button><a-button @click="noop"><PoweroffOutlined/>프로토콜 활성화</a-button><a-button danger @click="noop"><DeleteOutlined/>엔드포인트 삭제</a-button><a-button @click="noop">NFSv4 ID 매핑</a-button><a-button :loading="refreshing" @click="refresh"><ReloadOutlined/>업데이트</a-button><a-button @click="wide=!wide"><FullscreenOutlined/>{{wide?'기본 보기':'넓게 보기'}}</a-button></a-space></div>
<a-alert v-if="notice" show-icon type="info" :message="notice" closable @close="notice=''"/>
<StorageNfsIdentityPanel :report="identity" mode="NAME_DOMAIN"/>
<div class="section-title"><h4>수신 포트 그룹</h4><span class="hint">2개 그룹 · 주소별 {{rows.length}}행 · 관측 2026-11-09 06:00:00 (예시)</span></div>
<a-alert v-if="scenario!=='fresh'" class="spaced" show-icon :type="scenario==='partial'?'error':'warning'" :message="scenarioLabel" description="등록 상태와 실행 관측을 구분합니다. 조회 실패·stale를 서비스 중지로 판단하지 않습니다."/>
<a-table size="small" class="listener-table spaced" row-key="key" :columns="columns" :data-source="rows" :pagination="false" :loading="refreshing" :scroll="{x:1330}">
<template #bodyCell="{column,record}"><template v-if="column.key==='address'"><code>{{record.address}}</code><div class="hint">{{record.family}} · {{record.role}}</div></template><template v-else-if="column.key==='mode'"><a-tag v-for="v in record.versions" :key="v">{{v}}</a-tag><div class="hint">{{record.mode}}</div></template><template v-else-if="column.key==='binding'"><span>{{record.configBinding}}</span><div class="hint">실행 {{record.actualBinding}}</div></template><template v-else-if="column.key==='state'"><a-tag :color="record.color">{{record.state}}</a-tag><div class="hint">{{record.reason}}</div></template><template v-else-if="column.key==='actions'"><a-space :size="4"><a-button size="small" @click="open(record)">상세</a-button><a-tooltip title="연결된 내보내기가 있어 포트 그룹 삭제 불가"><span><a-button size="small" danger disabled>삭제</a-button></span></a-tooltip></a-space></template><template v-else-if="column.key==='exports'"><a @click="open(record)">{{record.exports}}개</a></template></template></a-table>
<p class="hint">전체 수신은 모든 인터페이스에서 리슨함을 뜻합니다. 주소별 행은 접속 주소이며 별도 리스너 프로세스 수가 아닙니다. 삭제는 원래 포트 그룹 단위 보호를 사용합니다.</p>
<div class="section-title"><h4>NFS 내보내기 목록</h4><span class="hint">기존 경로·POSIX·ACL·볼륨 열과 작업 유지</span></div>
<a-table class="spaced" size="small" row-key="id" :columns="exportColumns" :data-source="exports" :pagination="false" :scroll="{x:1050}"><template #bodyCell="{column,record}"><a-tooltip v-if="column.key==='groups'"><template #title><div v-for="g in record.groupDetails" :key="g">{{g}}</div></template><a @click="openExport(record)">{{record.groups}}개 그룹 · {{record.endpoints}}개 주소</a></a-tooltip><a-tag v-else-if="column.key==='state'" color="green">Ready</a-tag><a-space v-else-if="column.key==='actions'" :size="4"><a-button size="small" @click="noop">편집</a-button><a-button size="small" @click="noop">확장</a-button><a-button size="small" danger @click="noop">삭제</a-button></a-space></template></a-table>
<p class="hint">이 목업의 예시 내보내기 경로·권한은 생략한 기존 열을 재설계한다는 의미가 아닙니다. ACL·백킹 볼륨·세션 영역은 기존대로 유지합니다.</p>
</a-tab-pane><a-tab-pane key="smb" tab="SMB"/><a-tab-pane key="iscsi" tab="iSCSI"/><a-tab-pane key="nvme" tab="NVMe-oF"/><a-tab-pane key="backup" tab="구성 백업"/><a-tab-pane key="runtime" tab="런타임"/><a-tab-pane key="boot" tab="부팅 복구"/><a-tab-pane key="network" tab="네트워크"/><a-tab-pane key="operations" tab="작업 내역"/></a-tabs></a-card></template></ResourceLayout></main></div></div>
<MoldDialog :visible="!!selectedRow" title="NFS 리스너 관측 상세" size="lg" @cancel="selectedRow=null"><template v-if="selectedRow"><a-alert show-icon type="info" message="등록한 포트 그룹과 실행 관측을 함께 표시합니다." description="조회 전용입니다. 이 화면에서 IP·포트·ACL을 변경하지 않습니다."/><a-descriptions bordered :column="1" size="small" class="spaced"><a-descriptions-item label="포트 그룹">{{selectedRow.group}} / {{selectedRow.port}}</a-descriptions-item><a-descriptions-item label="설정 모드">{{selectedRow.mode}}</a-descriptions-item><a-descriptions-item label="접속 주소"><code>{{selectedRow.endpoint}}</code></a-descriptions-item><a-descriptions-item label="설정 수신 범위">{{selectedRow.configBinding}}</a-descriptions-item><a-descriptions-item label="실행 수신 범위">{{selectedRow.actualBinding}}</a-descriptions-item><a-descriptions-item label="관측 상태">{{selectedRow.state}} · {{selectedRow.reason}}</a-descriptions-item><a-descriptions-item label="관측 출처">inventory.nfsGaneshaExports / health.nfsGanesha.endpoints</a-descriptions-item><a-descriptions-item label="관측 시각">2026-11-09 06:00:00 (설계 예시)</a-descriptions-item><a-descriptions-item label="연결 내보내기">{{selectedRow.exports}}개 · {{selectedRow.group==='G1'?'ordered-main, shared-common':'ordered-sibling, shared-common'}}</a-descriptions-item></a-descriptions>
<h4 class="spaced">그룹의 접속 주소</h4><a-table size="small" row-key="key" :columns="dialogColumns" :data-source="dialogRows" :pagination="false" :scroll="{x:850}"/><p class="hint">실제 관측에 없는 주소는 설정상 주소 / 관측 전으로 표시합니다. 바인딩·내보내기 권한이 검증됐다는 의미를 주소 목록만으로 부여하지 않습니다.</p></template><template #footer><a-button type="primary" @click="selectedRow=null">닫기</a-button></template></MoldDialog>
</div></a-config-provider></template>
<script>
import koKR from 'ant-design-vue/es/locale/ko_KR'
import Breadcrumb from '@/components/widgets/Breadcrumb.vue'
import ResourceLayout from '@/layouts/ResourceLayout.vue'
import MoldDialog from '@/components/view/MoldDialog.vue'
import StorageNfsIdentityPanel from '@/components/view/StorageNfsIdentityPanel.vue'
import {ReloadOutlined,PlusOutlined,DownOutlined,FileTextOutlined,DeleteOutlined,PoweroffOutlined,FullscreenOutlined} from '@ant-design/icons-vue'
const q=new URLSearchParams(location.search)
export default {components:{Breadcrumb,ResourceLayout,MoldDialog,StorageNfsIdentityPanel,ReloadOutlined,PlusOutlined,DownOutlined,FileTextOutlined,DeleteOutlined,PoweroffOutlined,FullscreenOutlined},
data(){return {locale:koKR,tab:'nfs',dark:q.get('theme')==='dark',wide:q.get('wide')==='1',scenario:q.get('scenario')||'fresh',refreshing:false,notice:'',selectedRow:null,
identity:{mode:'NAME_DOMAIN',policyrevision:0,effectivemode:'NAME_DOMAIN',observationstatus:'APPLIED',observeddomain:'localdomain',endpoints:[]},
columns:[{title:'접속 주소 / 역할',key:'address',fixed:'left',width:255},{title:'포트',key:'port',dataIndex:'port',width:75},{title:'NFS 버전 / 모드',key:'mode',width:150},{title:'설정 / 실행 수신 범위',key:'binding',width:205},{title:'실행 관측',key:'state',width:235},{title:'연결 내보내기',key:'exports',width:120},{title:'작업',key:'actions',fixed:'right',width:160}],
exportColumns:[{title:'내보내기 이름',dataIndex:'name',fixed:'left',width:175},{title:'클라이언트 마운트 루트',dataIndex:'path',width:300},{title:'연결 포트 그룹',key:'groups',width:200},{title:'권한 / 매핑',dataIndex:'permission',width:160},{title:'상태',key:'state',width:85},{title:'작업',key:'actions',fixed:'right',width:200}],
dialogColumns:[{title:'IP / 포트',dataIndex:'endpoint',width:330},{title:'주소 역할',dataIndex:'role',width:120},{title:'설정 모드',dataIndex:'mode',width:160},{title:'실행 관측',dataIndex:'state',width:180}],
exports:[{id:'main',name:'ordered-main',path:'10.10.13.186:/ordered-main',groups:1,endpoints:3,groupDetails:['2049 · NFSv4 전용','10.10.13.186:2049 (주 IP)','10.10.13.188:2049 (별칭·합성)','[2001:db8:13::186]:2049 (IPv6·합성)'],permission:'RW / Root Squash'},{id:'common',name:'shared-common',path:'10.10.13.186:/shared-common',groups:2,endpoints:4,groupDetails:['2049 · NFSv4 전용 · 주소 3개','2050 · NFSv4 전용 · 주소 1개'],permission:'RW / Root Squash'}]}},
watch:{dark:{immediate:true,handler(v){document.body.classList.toggle('dark-mode',v)}}},
mounted(){if(q.get('dialog'))this.selectedRow=this.rows[0]},
computed:{details(){return [['이름','sharedfs-listeners-design'],['상태','Ready'],['주 IP','10.10.13.186 (예시)'],['프로비저닝','SPARSE'],['계정','admin'],['Zone','13-Zone']]},scenarioLabel(){return {partial:'2050 포트의 실제 리슨 실패 · 다른 그룹의 정상 관측 유지',stale:'관측 유효기간 경과 · 마지막 관측값 유지',unavailable:'관측 조회 실패 · 기존 행 유지 / 실행 상태 미확인'}[this.scenario]},rows(){return [
{key:'G1-v4-primary',group:'G1',address:'10.10.13.186',family:'IPv4',role:'주 IP',port:2049,endpoint:'10.10.13.186:2049',mode:'V4_ONLY',versions:['NFSv4'],configBinding:'전체 수신',actualBinding:'0.0.0.0:2049',exports:2},
{key:'G1-v4-alias',group:'G1',address:'10.10.13.188',family:'IPv4',role:'별칭 · 합성',port:2049,endpoint:'10.10.13.188:2049',mode:'V4_ONLY',versions:['NFSv4'],configBinding:'전체 수신',actualBinding:'0.0.0.0:2049',exports:2},
{key:'G1-v6',group:'G1',address:'2001:db8:13:1463:abcd:1234:5678:186',family:'IPv6',role:'별칭 · 합성',port:2049,endpoint:'[2001:db8:13:1463:abcd:1234:5678:186]:2049',mode:'V4_ONLY',versions:['NFSv4'],configBinding:'전체 수신',actualBinding:'[::]:2049',exports:2},
{key:'G2-v4',group:'G2',address:'10.10.13.186',family:'IPv4',role:'지정 IP',port:2050,endpoint:'10.10.13.186:2050',mode:'V4_ONLY',versions:['NFSv4'],configBinding:'10.10.13.186',actualBinding:'0.0.0.0:2050',exports:2}
].map(x=>({...x,...(this.scenario==='stale'?{state:'오래된 관측',reason:'마지막 정상 · 현재 실행 미확인',color:'orange'}:this.scenario==='unavailable'?{state:'조회 실패',reason:'마지막 관측 유지 · 실행 미확인',color:'orange'}:this.scenario==='partial'&&x.group==='G2'?{state:'리스너 실패',reason:'listening=false · 현재 관측',color:'red'}:{state:'실행 확인',reason:'프로세스·리슨 확인 (예시)',color:'green'})}))},dialogRows(){return this.rows.filter(x=>x.group===this.selectedRow?.group)}},
methods:{noop(){this.notice='설계 목업입니다. 실제 API 요청이나 자원 변경은 실행하지 않습니다.'},refresh(){this.refreshing=true;setTimeout(()=>{this.refreshing=false},700)},open(row){this.selectedRow=row},openExport(row){this.selectedRow=this.rows[0]}}}
</script>
<style>
.design-root{min-height:100vh;background:var(--ui-bg-page);color:var(--ui-text-primary)}.design-note{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 16px;background:var(--ui-bg-elevated);border-bottom:1px solid var(--ui-border);font-size:12px}.design-note>span{flex:1;color:var(--ui-text-secondary)}.shell{display:flex;min-height:calc(100vh - 50px)}aside{width:200px;flex-shrink:0;padding:20px 16px;background:var(--ui-bg-elevated);border-right:1px solid var(--ui-border)}aside>b{font-size:26px}aside p{margin:28px 8px}.selected{padding:12px;background:var(--ui-bg-secondary);color:var(--ui-link);border-radius:4px}.workspace{flex:1;min-width:0}header{height:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 24px;background:var(--ui-bg-elevated);border-bottom:1px solid var(--ui-border)}.breadcrumb-card{border-radius:0}.breadcrumb-card>.ant-card-body{padding:16px 24px}.right{text-align:right}main{padding:16px 24px}.info h3{overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:var(--ui-text-primary);margin:16px 0}.icon{font-size:36px;color:var(--ui-link)}dt{font-weight:600;margin:16px 0 4px}dd{margin:0}.tab-card>.ant-card-body{padding:16px}.tab-card .ant-tabs-nav{min-width:112px}.tab-card .ant-tabs-content-holder{min-width:0}.nfs-design-toolbar{margin-bottom:16px}.nfs-design-toolbar .ant-space{margin-bottom:0!important}.section-title{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-top:16px}.section-title h4{margin:0;color:var(--ui-text-primary)}.spaced{margin-top:12px}.hint{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--ui-text-secondary);margin:4px 0}.listener-table code{color:inherit;white-space:normal;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.listener-table .ant-table-cell{vertical-align:top}.detail{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;width:100%;padding:4px 0}.detail strong{color:var(--ui-text-secondary)}@media(max-width:1000px){aside{display:none}main{padding:16px}.design-note>span{display:none}}
</style>
